                  <photoshop:LayerText>Working Frequency : 860~928MHz Reading Distance : Up to 10 meters for UHF1-10E  and UHF1-10F (Determined by the environment and reader) Protocol : ISO18000-6C Memory Capacity : 800 bits Chip UID : 64 bytes Storage Structure : EPC: 96 bits; TID: 96 bits; User : 512  bits; Password: 64 bits Data Storage : 5 years ( Only for chip ) Working Temperature : -30‚ÑÉ ~ 55‚ÑÉ Storage Temperature : -10‚ÑÉ ~ 40‚ÑÉ Storage Humidity : 40%-50% RH Dimension : 85mm*54mm*0.8mmÔºà error¬±0.06mm ) Packaging Process : Hot Laminating </photoshop:LayerText>
